(5930787, 865166, 51793, '<td valign="top">This is a really good picture. They are so precious aren''t they?</td>', 'This is a really good picture. They are so precious aren''t they?', '2010-04-05 01:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5930896, 865125, 95418, '<td valign="top">Good photo!</td>', 'Good photo!', '2010-04-05 01:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5930898, 865135, 52336, '<td valign="top">Hello, I''m commenting on entries in this challenge that I think will score within the top ten, and remarking on what I <i>don''t</i> like about them.  This is a visually remarkable image with a lot of perfectly complementary colours.  It''s dramatic for its well-handled light and striking vibrancy.  Setup, though minimal, is lovely, as is the composition.  Very nice.  I don''t like the forced metaphor you''ve presented (and reinforced with the title), and I feel this little girl''s pose is very artificial.  A niggle is the hard shadowline on her forearm.  8</td>', 'Hello, I''m commenting on entries in this challenge that I think will score within the top ten, and remarking on what I don''t like about them.  This is a visually remarkable image with a lot of perfectly complementary colours.  It''s dramatic for its well-handled light and striking vibrancy.  Setup, though minimal, is lovely, as is the composition.  Very nice.  I don''t like the forced metaphor you''ve presented (and reinforced with the title), and I feel this little girl''s pose is very artificial.  A niggle is the hard shadowline on her forearm.  8', '2010-04-05 01:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
