(5933586, 864834, 33769, '<td valign="top">I love this- for both the comical and the action factor (10) -- that said - since its advanced editing i might have sharpened/ dodged and burned a bit more - i love the composition and the shape of the child the lawnmower and the grass (triangular) it keeps the eye in the frame; very nicely done - good idea :-)</td>', 'I love this- for both the comical and the action factor (10) -- that said - since its advanced editing i might have sharpened/ dodged and burned a bit more - i love the composition and the shape of the child the lawnmower and the grass (triangular) it keeps the eye in the frame; very nicely done - good idea :-)', '2010-04-06 15:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
