(5933674, 865104, 33769, '<td valign="top">as a fellow redhead- i''m rather biased and immediatly love this image ;)  I would reccomend a light brush under the eyes to lighten the shadows (dodge/burn) inside  the eyes to really make them pop or use a diffrent flash in the future perhaps? :-) remember the challenge allows for advanced editing! :-) perhaps crop or clone out that incidental blue thing in the background above her head  :-) i hope this does well !</td>', 'as a fellow redhead- i''m rather biased and immediatly love this image ;)  I would reccomend a light brush under the eyes to lighten the shadows (dodge/burn) inside  the eyes to really make them pop or use a diffrent flash in the future perhaps? :-) remember the challenge allows for advanced editing! :-) perhaps crop or clone out that incidental blue thing in the background above her head  :-) i hope this does well !', '2010-04-06 16:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5933677, 865087, 33769, '<td valign="top">LOL  -adorable- and great focus; I probably would have cropped some of the height out of the image because I love that silly-expression and how sharp it is; that is definatly a child captured being a child :-D</td>', 'LOL  -adorable- and great focus; I probably would have cropped some of the height out of the image because I love that silly-expression and how sharp it is; that is definatly a child captured being a child :-D', '2010-04-06 16:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5933710, 865153, 33769, '<td valign="top">Absolutely -adore- this image, its precious that all the little ones are in blue and have curly hair/same color hair -  I love the yellow bucket thrown into the mix it works as a centerpoint for the eye- and keeps drawing me back into the center of the photo even as my eye starts to wander towards the other two subjects... lovely composure- nicely cropped/ this i predict will do very well! :-)</td>', 'Absolutely -adore- this image, its precious that all the little ones are in blue and have curly hair/same color hair -  I love the yellow bucket thrown into the mix it works as a centerpoint for the eye- and keeps drawing me back into the center of the photo even as my eye starts to wander towards the other two subjects... lovely composure- nicely cropped/ this i predict will do very well! :-)', '2010-04-06 16:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5933716, 864934, 33769, '<td valign="top">whimsical- very sweet- i love how you did the selective desaturation; i do wish more of her head in the reflection had been ''colorized'' or even a more gradent tone was used on the water to colorize it may  have enhanced it more in my opinion? but overall i do love it- its one of the images i scored on the highest end :-) because of the princess magical feel to the composition of her diping her toe in the water...  nicely done :-)</td>', 'whimsical- very sweet- i love how you did the selective desaturation; i do wish more of her head in the reflection had been ''colorized'' or even a more gradent tone was used on the water to colorize it may  have enhanced it more in my opinion? but overall i do love it- its one of the images i scored on the highest end :-) because of the princess magical feel to the composition of her diping her toe in the water...  nicely done :-)', '2010-04-06 16:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5933722, 865097, 33769, '<td valign="top">Adorable- and I love how you worked with the green grass/ green on the back of the shoes by balancing it with a green object in her hand; even more I love that the subject is a redhead (I am a little biased in the fact that I am a redhead and adore redheaded children - it helps that the image is well composed and everything that should be in focus is in focus - love how you got her with 1 foot up too :-) can just see her toddling along in the woods :-) nice non-invasive border as well :-) overall highly scored :-)</td>', 'Adorable- and I love how you worked with the green grass/ green on the back of the shoes by balancing it with a green object in her hand; even more I love that the subject is a redhead (I am a little biased in the fact that I am a redhead and adore redheaded children - it helps that the image is well composed and everything that should be in focus is in focus - love how you got her with 1 foot up too :-) can just see her toddling along in the woods :-) nice non-invasive border as well :-) overall highly scored :-)', '2010-04-06 16:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5933724, 864950, 33769, '<td valign="top">this is so sweet and photojournalistic, I adore the hands in the pockets and looking where she is walking; the black and white almost sepia feel to this image makes it feel timeless and classic; the lighting/dodging/burning on sides is nicely done to keep the eye focused on the subject... wondering what she is thinking about as she steps over the crack  :-)</td>', 'this is so sweet and photojournalistic, I adore the hands in the pockets and looking where she is walking; the black and white almost sepia feel to this image makes it feel timeless and classic; the lighting/dodging/burning on sides is nicely done to keep the eye focused on the subject... wondering what she is thinking about as she steps over the crack  :-)', '2010-04-06 16:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5933726, 865186, 33769, '<td valign="top">I think this image is very enchanting in a magical childhood kind of way; i do wish the subjects eyes were a bit sharper - because they are beautiful and i understand the soft focus because its a lovely style for portraits... i would still -love- to see this done again sharper perhaps eyes nose mouth and edge of flower- (basically center of image in focus with fine detail) and the rest of the image softly oof :-) lovely choices of color to contrast the darkness of the subjects eyes and I like the crop as well- not too close and not too far out- its just...perfect :-)</td>', 'I think this image is very enchanting in a magical childhood kind of way; i do wish the subjects eyes were a bit sharper - because they are beautiful and i understand the soft focus because its a lovely style for portraits... i would still -love- to see this done again sharper perhaps eyes nose mouth and edge of flower- (basically center of image in focus with fine detail) and the rest of the image softly oof :-) lovely choices of color to contrast the darkness of the subjects eyes and I like the crop as well- not too close and not too far out- its just...perfect :-)', '2010-04-06 16:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5933727, 865011, 33769, '<td valign="top">really sharp photo-  love the colors and the feel of action tho the subject is standing still... nicely done! :-) the classic fake smile just makes me laugh because all kids seem to do that when they see their photo being taken  :-)</td>', 'really sharp photo-  love the colors and the feel of action tho the subject is standing still... nicely done! :-) the classic fake smile just makes me laugh because all kids seem to do that when they see their photo being taken  :-)', '2010-04-06 16:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
