(5938924, 864910, 2158, '<td valign="top">I really don''t get the selective desaturation here.  The colour use seems to suggest that the shirt is more important than the boy.  I''ve seen this done commercially, but to me it doesn''t make sense.  I''m sure this would look really good in colour though.</td>', 'I really don''t get the selective desaturation here.  The colour use seems to suggest that the shirt is more important than the boy.  I''ve seen this done commercially, but to me it doesn''t make sense.  I''m sure this would look really good in colour though.', '2010-04-09 20:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5938930, 864781, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done, but BIGGER!</td>', 'Beautifully done, but BIGGER!', '2010-04-09 20:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5938932, 864862, 76335, '<td valign="top">That left eye, the closer eye, should be the one in sharper focus. I do like the high key effect, but think that the shadows present should be darker to help define and balance the composition. My two cents.</td>', 'That left eye, the closer eye, should be the one in sharper focus. I do like the high key effect, but think that the shadows present should be darker to help define and balance the composition. My two cents.', '2010-04-09 20:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
