(5939146, 864890, 33769, '<td valign="top">i think a closer zoom/capture would give this more of a ''wow'' factor for me... the little girl with her arms grinning at the bubbles- is an excellent focal point- the rest seems very distracting to me... - i think its because i can clearly see her expression of joy and laughter as she''s about to clap her hands on a batch of bubbles -  zoomed in on her  with the others in the background either sharp or a little OOF its very colorful so perhaps that is also what is pulling my eyes all over the place.. maybe - as is ... black and white conversion?    or selective de-saturation? just thoughts/suggestions- its about 1am  - just trying to comment and be helpful! :-)  goodluck !</td>', 'i think a closer zoom/capture would give this more of a ''wow'' factor for me... the little girl with her arms grinning at the bubbles- is an excellent focal point- the rest seems very distracting to me... - i think its because i can clearly see her expression of joy and laughter as she''s about to clap her hands on a batch of bubbles -  zoomed in on her  with the others in the background either sharp or a little OOF its very colorful so perhaps that is also what is pulling my eyes all over the place.. maybe - as is ... black and white conversion?    or selective de-saturation? just thoughts/suggestions- its about 1am  - just trying to comment and be helpful! :-)  goodluck !', '2010-04-10 01:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
