(5940094, 864705, 47852, '<td valign="top">What a fun shot!  Love the background too, really adds to the fun!  I think a quick boost of the contrast would bring the darker areas to a more solid black and give the shot a crisper feel.  Nicely done!</td>', 'What a fun shot!  Love the background too, really adds to the fun!  I think a quick boost of the contrast would bring the darker areas to a more solid black and give the shot a crisper feel.  Nicely done!', '2010-04-11 09:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
