(5940474, 865162, 76335, '<td valign="top">I do like the high key effect and pastel colors. The grain works well too. And yes, his expression. Timeless. An eight for you.</td>', 'I do like the high key effect and pastel colors. The grain works well too. And yes, his expression. Timeless. An eight for you.', '2010-04-11 19:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5940477, 864731, 51747, '<td valign="top">Made me smile. I can''t tell what the kid thinks of the headphones and the big camera right in it''s face :D</td>', 'Made me smile. I can''t tell what the kid thinks of the headphones and the big camera right in it''s face :D', '2010-04-11 19:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5940478, 865125, 51747, '<td valign="top">Pretty good catch. I wonder if you couldn''t have made the rider stand out more against the BG. Lots of shades of gray here competing.</td>', 'Pretty good catch. I wonder if you couldn''t have made the rider stand out more against the BG. Lots of shades of gray here competing.', '2010-04-11 19:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
