(5940607, 864968, 76335, '<td valign="top">Okay, I''m digging this. It''s the low angle, and the blurred clouds that look like something out of a storybook. More that anything, it''s that totally confident strut that''s about to take him out of the frame -- as if to say, "Eat my dust!" <br/> <br/>Really good. An eight for you.</td>', 'Okay, I''m digging this. It''s the low angle, and the blurred clouds that look like something out of a storybook. More that anything, it''s that totally confident strut that''s about to take him out of the frame -- as if to say, "Eat my dust!"  Really good. An eight for you.', '2010-04-11 21:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
