(5946881, 865153, 69684, '<td valign="top">I liked this one (7). Great image with nice light, although (in my opinion) it screams for a T/S lens so that all three are in focus.</td>', 'I liked this one (7). Great image with nice light, although (in my opinion) it screams for a T/S lens so that all three are in focus.', '2010-04-14 17:55:55.000000', NULL, 0),
