(5952949, 864950, 18367, '<td valign="top">A truly spectacular image.<br/> <br/>I gave this image a 9 and after seeing it again I am sorry I didn''t give it a ten.  Not unlike <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=6519" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Beetle</a>, this image renders me speechless.<br/> <br/>Keep up the good work.<br/> <br/>Ray</td>', 'A truly spectacular image. I gave this image a 9 and after seeing it again I am sorry I didn''t give it a ten.  Not unlike  Beetle, this image renders me speechless. Keep up the good work. Ray', '2010-04-18 22:11:40.000000', NULL, 0),
