(6001948, 864939, 106349, '<td valign="top">Portraits are tough. My initial reaction is that I would like to see more color in the dress, especially on the bottom left. Seems like you could add a tiny bit more sharpness in the flowers, and maybe her eyes.</td>', 'Portraits are tough. My initial reaction is that I would like to see more color in the dress, especially on the bottom left. Seems like you could add a tiny bit more sharpness in the flowers, and maybe her eyes.', '2010-05-11 21:50:41.000000', NULL, 0);
